VERSION 2
RULE baseline.mobile.xplat.reactnative.framework.expo.expo_updates_without_code_signing VERSION 1
IN FILE
WHEN TEXT_MATCHES "\"expo-updates\"|expoConfig.*updates" "im"
WHEN TEXT_MISSING "codeSigningCertificate|codeSigningMetadata|code-signing" "im"
REPORT "Expo Updates Without Code Signing"
SEVERITY INFO
CONFIDENCE LOW
WITH TRACE
